  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2102.05 ADS contractor identification information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2102.05 “ADS contractor identification information” means the license number and expiration date of the license issued to a contractor for work at asbestos disposal sites pursuant to RSA 141-E:10, I, and Env-A 1811.\n\nSource. #7647, eff 2-16-02 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 2100) (formerly Env-Wm 3902.05); ss by #9645, eff 2-16-10; ss by #12605, eff 9-1-18",
